<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n76431" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάγη</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], ἡ, </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πήγνυμι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>anything that
				fixes</i> or <i>fastens, snare, noose</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ πάγης ἁλόντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.121
				</span></i>
			.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έ; ἐν τῇ π. ἐνέχεσθαι</span>
				ib.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β́</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
			</span></i><i>Lg..</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				824a
			</span></i>; <i>fowling-net</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				1.6.39
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>trap, snare</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάγας
			ἐραξάμεσθα</span> (leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφραξάμεσθα</span>) <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				822
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ὑπόπυροι</span>, of the
			beacons of Nauplius, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				435
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
